{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the OrePlant Demo Version!</strong></h2>Curious souls <strong>Finn</strong> and <strong>Maru</strong> are suddenly swept away into a mysterious new world by an unknown magical force! In this world, a legendary World Tree stands tall\u2014and with your touch, this enchanting land can come back to life. Join your adorable companion <strong>Aria</strong> and explore, restore, and nurture this magical realm together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/20e7c828d18c26340ef60e81f7cdda01.avif?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=2321 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/faa6f6bc03860841c38b06262068bb47.avif?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=1999 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/47669c128dfaadb777ddafb950e202ee.webp?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=5 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><strong><u>\ud83c\udfa3 Fishing with the Adorable 'Dambi'</u></strong><br>Fishing just got cuter with your little weasel friend Dambi! \ud83e\udda6\ud83d\udc96<br>Relax by the water and enjoy healing moments as you fish together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.poster.avif?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.webm?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/85eb858c938a71126fb7fcf6f4230796.mp4?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong><u>\ud83e\udd16 Grow Minerals with Helpful Robots</u></strong><br>Automated robots help you cultivate mineral plants! \u26cf\ufe0f\ud83c\udf3f<br>Increase efficiency and manage your farm like a pro.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.poster.avif?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.webm?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/de8583ad9298ff8b157ea5d6f3f92640.mp4?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong><u>\ud83c\udf73 A Variety of Cooking Systems</u></strong><br>Use harvested crops and caught fish to cook a wide range of dishes!<br>Finished meals grant your characters useful buffs. \ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f\u2728<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.poster.avif?t=1760518648\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.webm?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377860/extras/d3c13c408cb4ee3df27ae676b7e2eb6f.mp4?t=1760518648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong><u>\ud83c\udfa5 Immersive Storytelling &amp; Direction</u></strong><br>A warm, engaging narrative awaits you.<br>Embark on a heartwarming adventure with charming and unique characters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla